      "text": [
        "4953 - وَ قَالَ اَلصَّادِقُ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ : \"مَنْ قَتَلَ نَفْسَهُ مُتَعَمِّداً فَهُوَ فِي نَارِ \" جَهَنَّمُ خٰالِداً فِيهٰا\" \"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4953 - Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) said:\n\"Whoever intentionally kills himself will be in the Fire of Hell, abiding therein forever.\""
        ]
      }
